---
layout: base.njk
title: "AeroClub | Phase 05: Results"
---
<style>
    /* ... Copy identical <style> block from Phase 3/4 ... */
    .report-container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 20px 140px; }
    .report-meta { font-family: var(--font-data); font-size: 13px; color: var(--accent-cyan); letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 16px; display: block; }
    .report-title { font-size: 48px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-light); letter-spacing: -1px; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1.1; }
    .data-table-wrapper { background: var(--bg-panel-dark); border: 1px solid var(--border-dark); border-radius: 4px; overflow-x: auto; margin-top: 40px; }
    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; text-align: left; }
    th { padding: 20px 24px; font-family: var(--font-data); font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-dark); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2); }
    td { padding: 16px 24px; font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-light); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); }
    tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
    tr:hover td { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); }
</style>

<main>
    <div class="report-container">
        <a href="/join_us/spring-2027/" style="font-family: var(--font-data); color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 40px; transition: color 0.2s;">← Back to Dashboard</a>

        <span class="report-meta" style="color: #10B981;">PHASE 05 // COMPLETED</span>
        <h1 class="report-title">Final Induction Roster</h1>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 800px;">Following a rigorous 4-week evaluation cycle, the division is pleased to announce the Spring 2027 induction cohort. These individuals demonstrated exceptional technical aptitude, problem-solving capabilities, and cultural fit during the panel interviews. Welcome to the team.</p>

        <div class="data-table-wrapper">
            <table style="border-left: 4px solid #10B981;">
                <thead><tr><th>Inductee Name</th><th>Assigned Division</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody>
                    {% for applicant in csvData %}
                        {% if applicant['Final Status'] == 'Inducted' %}
                        <tr>
                            <td>{{ applicant['Full Name'] }}</td>
                            <td>{{ applicant['Division Preference'] }}</td>
                            <td style="color: #10B981; font-weight: 700;">INDUCTED</td>
                        </tr>
                        {% endif %}
                    {% endfor %}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>
</main>
